+the easement will then no longer apply to
+any portion of the property removed from
+the ASC; and
+(3) Comply with paragraphs Q.1.a through
+Q.1.d above.
+c. Within 90 days of approval of your claim,
+you must move your building to a new location outside the ASC. FEMA will give you an
+additional 30 days to move if you show there
+is sufficient reason to extend the time.
